I had to make a few changes to get seahaven to compile under g++.
Here's the diffs for anyone that's interested.  You'll get a warning
about flock being declared inconsistently, but it didn't seem to
affect the program, so I didn't try to make it go away.  The diffs
work for both /bin/make and gnumake on my Sun4/280 (SunOS 4.0).

William Setzer
setzer@matagh.ncsu.edu

